<p>It is also popularly termed as Manchester of the East. The textile industry is very well developed here as no other else has. Ahmedabad is a land of the 'Father of the Nation' Mahatma Gandhi and has witnessed many movements of Indian Independence.<br />
<a href="Uttar-Pradesh-Destinations/Allahabad.aspx">MORE...</a> 
