<p>Surrounded by Aravalli hills, the erstwhile state of Mewat, Alwar is crowned by a magnificent fort that has been a witness to many-a-battles and wars in the turbulent history of Alwar. A Rajput state for a long time, its nearness to the Mughal capital of Delhi.<a href="Rajasthan-Destinations/Alwar.aspx">MORE...</a></p> 
<br/>
