<p>Bhopal is the capital city of Madhya Pradesh.Bhopal is also referred to as the City of Lakes because of the two beautiful lakes that are situated in the center of the city. Apart from its natural beauty, Bhopal is also famous for its mosques. The Taj-ul-Masjid in Bhopal is the largest mosque of India.<a href="Madhya-Pradesh-Destinations/Bhopal.aspx">MORE...</a> </p>
</td>
</tr>
