<a href="Goa.aspx"><strong>Goa Tour</strong></a>
<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/goa-tourism.jpg" style="width:120px;height:100px;float:left" class="thumb alignleft"  alt="Darjeeling" title="Darjeeling"  />
<p>Goa, the smallest state of India areawise, is situated on the west coast of India in Konkan region besides Arabian Sea. Panaji is the state’s capital and Vasco Da Gama the largest city.Goa is famous for its eminent beaches, churches and historical sites.<a href="Goa.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
<br/>
