<p>Surrounded by seven hills the city Satara in west Maharashtra is a natural gift near the confluence of River Krishna. The one-time capital of Marathas is encircled by Pune in the north, Solapur in the east, Sangli in the south and Ratnagiri from west. <a href="Maharashtra-Destinations/Satara.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
