<p>Solapur is a beautiful mix of Kannada, Marathi and Telugu culture. The name of Solapur is included in History in golden letters for enjoying freedom 3 days before India got independence. The statues of Mahatma Gandhi and many more freedom fighters stands in a memorial called Hutatma Chowk.<a href="Maharashtra-Destinations/Solapur.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
<br/>
</td>
</tr>
