<p>Pachmarhi is a hill station in Madhya Pradesh state of India.It is also known as "Satpura Ki Rani"(Queen of Satpura). It is situated at a height of 1000 metres in the valley of the Satpura Range in Hoshangabad district.Pachmarhi is about 210 kilometres from Bhopal, the capital of Madhya Pradesh.<a href="Madhya-Pradesh-Destinations/Pachmarhi.aspx">MORE...</a></p>
